%% Target workflow v1.1. Supplier debt at agreed-order confirmation: owner confirmed 2026-11-10.
flowchart TD
    UI[One user action] --> CMD[Authorized command and payload identity]
    CMD --> TX[One PostgreSQL transaction]
    TX --> LOCK[Lock period, document, stock keys, money and open items]
    LOCK --> VALIDATE[Validate state, ownership, history, quantities and currency]
    VALIDATE --> BATCH[PostingBatch]
    BATCH --> STOCK[StockEntry: physical quantities]
    BATCH --> JOURNAL[JournalEntry and JournalLine: balanced money effects]
    JOURNAL --> ITEMS[OpenItem: party detail of control-account lines]
    ITEMS --> MATCH[SettlementMatch: which debt a payment closes]
    BATCH --> AUDIT[Audit and Outbox]
    STOCK --> COMMIT[Commit all effects or roll back all]
    JOURNAL --> COMMIT
    MATCH --> COMMIT
    AUDIT --> COMMIT
    COMMIT --> VIEWS[Authorized report views]
    VIEWS --> REPORTS[Stock, debts, cash, production, profit and holding]
